{"schemaVersion":2,"authors":[{"id":"marx","nameZh":"马克思","nameEn":"Karl Marx","years":"1818–1883","description":"哲学家、政治经济学家，《资本论》作者。","color":"7A2024"},{"id":"engels","nameZh":"恩格斯","nameEn":"Friedrich Engels","years":"1820–1895","description":"思想家，马克思的长期合作者，并整理出版《资本论》第二、三卷。","color":"315C4C"},{"id":"lenin","nameZh":"列宁","nameEn":"Vladimir Lenin","years":"1870–1924","description":"马克思主义理论家和革命家。","color":"8B4B22"},{"id":"stalin","nameZh":"斯大林","nameEn":"Joseph Stalin","years":"1878–1953","description":"苏联政治人物及著述者。","color":"4F4F63"},{"id":"mao","nameZh":"毛泽东","nameEn":"Mao Zedong","years":"1893–1976","description":"中国革命家和著述者。","color":"9A2E22"}],"books":[{"id":"marx-work-2940ce3bbbab","authorIds":["marx"],"seriesId":null,"titleZh":"马克思致莫里斯・拉沙特尔（1874年11月12日）","titleEn":"马克思致莫里斯・拉沙特尔（1874年11月12日）","language":"zh","category":"文章","year":"1874","sourceUrl":"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/mia-chinese-marx-letter-18741112.htm","sourceCredit":"Marxists Internet Archive","translator":"","rights":"PUBLIC_DOMAIN","description":"","chapters":[{"id":"chapter-001-2940ce3bbb","title":"马克思致莫里斯·拉沙特尔（1874年11月12日）","level":1,"content":["马克思致莫里斯・拉沙特尔（1874年11月12日）","1874年11月12日于伦敦亲爱的公民：","直至今日，我才回复您9日的来信，因为我刚从阿姆斯特丹赶回来，我被叫到那里处理家庭事务。我已于10月15日开始继续工作，并完全重写了鲁瓦先生的剩余译稿。目前要抄写大部分稿件，但这项工作会进行得很快，印刷厂厂主下周就会收到第一封邮件。既然再不会有耽搁，您尽可以通告读者，很快就会提供后续分册。","您忠诚的 卡尔・马克思感谢 先知在1917 收集、录入及校对"],"footnotes":[],"sections":[]}],"yearType":"SOURCE_DATE","yearBasis":"作品题名年份与来源页头部日期一致","yearEvidenceUrl":"https://www.marxists.org/chinese/marx/mia-chinese-marx-letter-18741112.htm","yearNote":"原目录年份为1877；依据题名与页面日期的一致信号校正","toc":[{"id":"toc-marx-work-2940ce3bbbab-root","parentId":null,"title":"马克思致莫里斯・拉沙特尔（1874年11月12日）","type":"PART","order":0,"chapterId":null,"paragraphIndex":0,"counterpartKey":"root"},{"id":"toc-marx-work-2940ce3bbbab-chapter-chapter-001-2940ce3bbb","parentId":"toc-marx-work-2940ce3bbbab-root","title":"马克思致莫里斯·拉沙特尔（1874年11月12日）","type":"CHAPTER","order":0,"chapterId":"chapter-001-2940ce3bbb","paragr